      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This article introduces the 60 top pharmacologic treatments provided for chronic orofacial pain patients. It explains that the majority of \"chronic\" orofacial pain patients will not find a \"cure\" to their pain with medications but may find a way to manage their pain. The medications in this article are the most commonly utilized \"pain\" medications and where it exists. This article reviews some of the current evidence supporting their use on chronic orofacial pain disorders."},
